00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:54,120
A two-way street.

1165
00:38:54,120 --> 00:38:55,200
It's also a promise

1166
00:38:55,200 --> 00:38:56,120
between us

1167
00:38:56,560 --> 00:38:57,240
and the audience.

1168
00:38:57,640 --> 00:38:58,560
I think this summer,

1169
00:38:58,560 --> 00:38:59,240
all our viewers

1170
00:38:59,240 --> 00:38:59,880
will get used

1171
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:00,520
to waiting

1172
00:39:00,520 --> 00:39:01,520
for a group

1173
00:39:01,520 --> 00:39:02,800
of passionate young people,

1174
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:04,720
watching them search for love

1175
00:39:04,720 --> 00:39:05,880
while also getting to see

1176
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:08,240
the beautiful friendships they built
along the way.

1177
00:39:09,120 --> 00:39:10,480
And now,

1178
00:39:10,480 --> 00:39:11,120
everyone...

1179
00:39:12,440 --> 00:39:14,400
We're about to see

1180
00:39:14,400 --> 00:39:16,080
