1190
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:35,280
For example,

1191
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:36,760
(Yu Yang, Liang Renfang)
Yu Yang and Fang.

1192
00:39:36,760 --> 00:39:37,240
Or like

1193
00:39:37,240 --> 00:39:38,520
(Cao Yiheng, Cui Kaiyi)
Cao Yiheng and Cui Kaiyi.

1194
00:39:38,520 --> 00:39:41,000
Will they actually

1195
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:42,400
stay as a couple?

1196
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:43,760
That's a big question.

1197
00:39:44,180 --> 00:39:46,120
