How big?

1198
00:39:49,040 --> 00:39:50,080
I went home and took a test.

1199
00:39:50,080 --> 00:39:50,920
I took some time to think.

1200
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,840
(We're not right for each other)
I think we're not right for each other.

1201
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:54,240
Don't want to be a couple.

1202
00:39:54,240 --> 00:39:56,640
Let's be husband and wife then?

1203
00:39:56,640 --> 00:39:57,960
(I get you)
Become husband and wife.

1204
00:39:58,400 --> 00:40:00,200
Who knows?

1205
00:40:00,200 --> 00:40:02,360
We don't know what will happen,

1206
00:40:02,360 --> 00:40:02,960
