1207
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:04,400
Just like Cui Yihang.

1208
00:40:04,400 --> 00:40:05,280
For Cui Yihang and Si.

1209
00:40:05,280 --> 00:40:05,560
Those two.

1210
00:40:05,560 --> 00:40:06,400
We don't know either.

1211
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,000
They've expressed

1212
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:08,320
their feelings,

1213
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:09,400
but right now...

1214
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:10,200
Who knows?

1215
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:11,640
What if?

1216
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:13,880
And then

1217
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:15,160
there's Sha Yue'er.

1218
00:40:16,480 --> 00:40:17,680
I really have no idea.

1219
00:40:17,680 --> 00:40:18,960
We really have no idea.

1220
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:20,760
We really don't know about her.

1221
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:21,520
So, everyone,

1222
00:40:21,520 --> 00:40:23,600
let's first take a look

1223
00:40:23,600 --> 00:40:25,840
at Cao Yiheng and Cui Kaiyi's

1224
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:27,160
