1225
00:40:27,160 --> 00:40:27,880
Here we go!

1226
00:40:27,880 --> 00:40:29,880
(Excited)
Oh my god.

1227
00:40:29,920 --> 00:40:31,040
Come on, everyone.

1228
00:40:31,040 --> 00:40:33,600
Let's do this.

1229
00:40:34,540 --> 00:40:35,940
(Both ears in)

1230
00:40:35,960 --> 00:40:37,360
I put both earbuds in.

1231
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:43,920
Let's go!

1232
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:45,200
The sky is so beautiful.

1233
00:40:47,440 --> 00:40:48,520
It's finally here.

1234
00:40:48,520 --> 00:40:50,200
We've waited all season for this.

1235
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:50,800
I'm so excited.

1236
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:51,720
The grand finale.

1237
00:40:51,720 --> 00:40:52,520
Yeah.

1238
00:40:52,760 --> 00:40:54,520
Woah.

1239
00:40:54,640 --> 00:40:55,320
So romantic.

1240
00:40:59,040 --> 00:40:59,720
Cao Yiheng.

1241
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:02,880
Handsome.

1242
00:41:06,040 --> 00:41:07,080
Cui Kaiyi.

1243
00:41:07,080 --> 00:41:08,640
So gorgeous.

1244
00:41:12,560 --> 00:41:13,880
Absolutely gorgeous.

1245
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,760
They're all so good-looking.

1246
00:41:25,040 --> 00:41:26,120
Stunning.

1247
00:41:26,120 --> 00:41:28,560
They're back to how they first met.

1248
00:41:35,960 --> 00:41:37,160
Cui Kaiyi has her hair up

1249
00:41:37,160 --> 00:41:38,360
