1250
00:41:42,080 --> 00:41:43,600
The final confession.

1251
00:41:43,600 --> 00:41:44,220
Here it is.

1252
00:41:44,220 --> 00:41:46,060
(Finally, the moment
we've been waiting for)

1253
00:41:50,600 --> 00:41:51,360
Isn't this

1254
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:53,240
the dress Cao Yiheng fell in love with her

1255
00:41:53,240 --> 00:41:54,800
