1256
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:58,080
Haitao, what do you think?

1257
00:41:58,080 --> 00:41:59,120
Your partner

1258
00:41:59,120 --> 00:42:01,360
showed up wearing the same outfit

1259
00:42:01,360 --> 00:42:03,360
