1260
00:42:03,360 --> 00:42:04,160
(That would be a killer move)

1261
00:42:04,160 --> 00:42:06,040
I'd burst into tears.

1262
00:42:12,660 --> 00:42:14,260
(Stops)

1263
00:42:19,520 --> 00:42:20,760
She's so full of energy.

1264
00:42:40,400 --> 00:42:41,880
We meet again.

1265
00:42:42,400 --> 00:42:43,680
We meet again.

1266
00:42:43,680 --> 00:42:45,600
You're looking so handsome today.

1267
00:42:46,640 --> 00:42:48,120
You look especially beautiful too.

1268
00:42:51,040 --> 00:42:53,480
You wore the yellow dress
from our first day.

1269
00:42:55,640 --> 00:42:57,040
You noticed.

1270
00:42:58,440 --> 00:43:00,000
It's not the same one.

1271
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:00,880
Just the same color.

1272
00:43:00,880 --> 00:43:02,640
Of course it's different.

1273
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:05,640
Let's go.

1274
00:43:06,560 --> 00:43:07,140
Okay.

1275
00:43:07,140 --> 00:43:07,900
(Holds hands)

1276
00:43:08,530 --> 00:43:12,240
♪Moonlight fell into daylight early♪

1277
00:43:13,340 --> 00:43:16,620
♪What're you thinking as you look down?♪

1278
00:43:17,130 --> 00:43:21,200
♪The breeze by the window
messes up your loose strands♪

1279
00:43:22,680 --> 00:43:24,240
So pretty.

1280
00:43:28,280 --> 00:43:29,680
It feels so official.

1281
00:43:29,680 --> 00:43:31,160
I'm about to cry.

1282
00:43:31,300 --> 00:43:32,900
(Little tear)

1283
00:43:33,360 --> 00:43:34,080
You too.

1284
00:43:34,480 --> 00:43:35,920
Yeah.

1285
00:43:37,320 --> 00:43:38,800
Are you nervous today?

1286
00:43:38,800 --> 00:43:39,640
Of course.

1287
00:43:39,640 --> 00:43:40,560
Are you nervous again?

1288
00:43:40,560 --> 00:43:41,720
It's our second confession.

1289
00:43:41,720 --> 00:43:42,920
Why are you still nervous?

1290
00:43:44,600 --> 00:43:45,560
I am.

1291
00:43:50,680 --> 00:43:52,880
Did you prepare a confession too?

1292
00:43:52,880 --> 00:43:54,680
Of course I did.

1293
00:43:54,680 --> 00:43:57,400
It's just a little hard to get out.

1294
00:43:57,400 --> 00:43:58,080
I'll go first then.

1295
00:43:58,080 --> 00:43:58,440
Sure.

1296
00:43:58,440 --> 00:43:59,120
You went first last time.

1297
00:43:59,120 --> 00:44:00,280
I'm scared I can't read mine

1298
00:44:00,280 --> 00:44:01,480
