1299
00:44:01,480 --> 00:44:02,960
Okay. You go first.

1300
00:44:04,320 --> 00:44:06,520
Mine's a little hard to get out too.

1301
00:44:06,520 --> 00:44:07,720
You're so cute.

1302
00:44:08,720 --> 00:44:09,560
Mine is pretty thick too.

1303
00:44:09,560 --> 00:44:11,240
When did you write all this?

1304
00:44:11,240 --> 00:44:14,920
I wrote it on the plane
and in the car today.

1305
00:44:14,920 --> 00:44:16,800
Then you didn't get much rest at all.

1306
00:44:17,880 --> 00:44:19,000
He feels bad for her.

1307
00:44:20,200 --> 00:44:23,000
It's all for today.
To see you and confess my feelings.

1308
00:44:25,160 --> 00:44:26,880
They're making me melt.

1309
00:44:26,880 --> 00:44:28,360
So nice.

1310
00:44:33,080 --> 00:44:33,880
I'm nervous.

1311
00:44:33,880 --> 00:44:35,400
She's really nervous.

1312
00:44:36,600 --> 00:44:38,240
Why are you taking such a deep breath?

1313
00:44:38,240 --> 00:44:40,800
You're making me nervous too.

1314
00:44:45,760 --> 00:44:49,640
For my Sunflower Cao Yiheng.

1315
00:44:51,520 --> 00:44:53,720
He can't stop smiling.

1316
00:44:55,560 --> 00:44:57,840
It looks like you've already noticed

1317
00:44:57,840 --> 00:44:59,600
I'm wearing a dress

1318
00:44:59,600 --> 00:45:03,560
that's very similar to the one
I wore at the first dinner.

1319
00:45:03,960 --> 00:45:05,160
Ever since you told me

1320
00:45:05,160 --> 00:45:06,160
that you'd been watching me

1321
00:45:06,160 --> 00:45:08,320
for a long time

1322
00:45:08,320 --> 00:45:10,800
at that dinner,

1323
00:45:12,640 --> 00:45:13,600
I was sure

1324
00:45:13,600 --> 00:45:15,760
I wanted to wear

1325
00:45:15,760 --> 00:45:17,680
this pale yellow dress again.

1326
00:45:17,680 --> 00:45:20,280
That night, I sat among the crowd.

1327
00:45:20,280 --> 00:45:22,000
But this time,

1328
00:45:22,000 --> 00:45:24,520
I'm dressed like this
for you and you alone.

1329
00:45:25,420 --> 00:45:27,460
(Only for you)

1330
00:45:27,480 --> 00:45:29,000
That's beautiful.

1331
00:45:29,720 --> 00:45:31,520
To the guy

1332
00:45:31,800 --> 00:45:34,960
who quietly sat in the corner,

1333
00:45:34,960 --> 00:45:36,280
I want to say...

1334
00:45:37,920 --> 00:45:38,920
I adore you.

1335
00:46:01,360 --> 00:46:02,880
What?

1336
00:46:03,640 --> 00:46:05,280
I adore you too.

1337
00:46:05,280 --> 00:46:07,000
That's only the first paragraph.

1338
00:46:07,320 --> 00:46:08,760
That's just the first paragraph?

1339
00:46:10,600 --> 00:46:11,440
She just read one paragraph,

1340
00:46:11,440 --> 00:46:12,840
and Dai Xu is already tearing up.

1341
00:46:14,040 --> 00:46:14,980
It's only one paragraph.

1342
00:46:14,980 --> 00:46:15,740
(Can't handle it anymore)

1343
00:46:16,160 --> 00:46:17,720
Keep reading. It's okay.

1344
00:46:19,520 --> 00:46:22,120
In our first week as a couple,

1345
00:46:22,120 --> 00:46:24,400
I heard so many things

1346
00:46:24,400 --> 00:46:26,640
I'd never heard before.

1347
00:46:29,360 --> 00:46:31,240
Every time we hugged,

1348
00:46:31,240 --> 00:46:33,880
I could hear our hearts beating faster.

1349
00:46:34,640 --> 00:46:35,520
Compared to before,

1350
00:46:35,520 --> 00:46:37,360
your voice got more clingy and sweet.

1351
00:46:40,200 --> 00:46:41,640
I learned that when we hug,

1352
00:46:41,640 --> 00:46:43,760
you like to bury your head against me.

1353
00:46:43,760 --> 00:46:45,240
How can you be so cute?

1354
00:46:50,440 --> 00:46:51,800
They say finding someone cute

1355
00:46:51,800 --> 00:46:53,920
is a sign that you like them.

1356
00:46:55,800 --> 00:46:57,680
So I guess I've completely

1357
00:46:57,680 --> 00:47:00,120
fallen for you now.

1358
00:47:00,500 --> 00:47:02,540
(Completely fallen for you)

1359
00:47:02,560 --> 00:47:03,640
So beautiful.

1360
00:47:09,840 --> 00:47:12,400
On our first night at the Couples House,

1361
00:47:12,400 --> 00:47:15,080
we went for a walk on the beach.

1362
00:47:15,080 --> 00:47:16,000
It was the first time

1363
00:47:16,000 --> 00:47:18,440
I saw how lively and carefree
you could be.

1364
00:47:18,960 --> 00:47:19,680
Honestly,

1365
00:47:19,680 --> 00:47:22,400
I had a selfish thought.

1366
00:47:22,400 --> 00:47:25,360
I wanted to hide this lively side of you

1367
00:47:25,360 --> 00:47:26,680
and keep it all to myself.

1368
00:47:29,160 --> 00:47:30,640
This is so sweet.

1369
00:47:34,000 --> 00:47:36,160
That day, I told the sea,

1370
00:47:36,160 --> 00:47:38,200
"Cao Yiheng, I like you."

1371
00:47:40,040 --> 00:47:42,640
But I also secretly made a wish.

1372
00:47:42,640 --> 00:47:44,960
I wished we'd keep
walking this road together.

1373
00:47:44,960 --> 00:47:46,280
That we'd always

1374
00:47:46,280 --> 00:47:47,920
have more days that belonged to us.

1375
00:47:47,920 --> 00:47:48,960
These quiet moments

1376
00:47:48,960 --> 00:47:50,520
when it's just the two of us.

1377
00:47:50,520 --> 00:47:52,240
I hope we can have more of them.

1378
00:47:52,240 --> 00:47:53,080
Just a little more.

1379
00:48:05,000 --> 00:48:06,760
Thank you, Cao Yiheng.

1380
00:48:11,360 --> 00:48:13,480
Thank you for all the warmth
you've given me.

1381
00:48:13,480 --> 00:48:15,880
Thank you for all the love
you've given me.

1382
00:48:17,920 --> 00:48:19,280
So happy.

1383
00:48:20,080 --> 00:48:23,560
That night, when they announced

1384
00:48:23,560 --> 00:48:25,960
