1387
00:48:32,400 --> 00:48:34,200
So cute.

1388
00:48:34,200 --> 00:48:36,720
It was another side of you
I'd never heard before.

1389
00:48:36,720 --> 00:48:39,280
I think I might need

1390
00:48:39,280 --> 00:48:42,000
a little stamp card for you.

1391
00:48:44,120 --> 00:48:46,280
When I discover a new side of you,

1392
00:48:46,640 --> 00:48:48,200
I'll make a little space

1393
00:48:48,200 --> 00:48:49,200
in my heart to stamp it

1394
00:48:49,200 --> 00:48:50,680
and keep it there forever.

1395
00:48:51,140 --> 00:48:54,940
(Keeping every new side
of you forever in my stamp card)

1396
00:48:55,480 --> 00:48:58,320
Just the day before,
I claimed so confidently

1397
00:48:58,320 --> 00:49:00,560
that I didn't have separation anxiety.

1398
00:49:02,440 --> 00:49:03,920
But the moment you hugged me,

1399
00:49:03,920 --> 00:49:05,280
I realized

1400
00:49:05,280 --> 00:49:07,280
I didn't want to leave you at all.

1401
00:49:14,280 --> 00:49:16,960
I'll never forget the night
you stayed with me

1402
00:49:17,640 --> 00:49:19,920
while I worked on my thesis,

1403
00:49:19,920 --> 00:49:22,440
or the morning you took me
to the airport.

1404
00:49:25,800 --> 00:49:28,400
After we leave the show,

1405
00:49:28,400 --> 00:49:29,960
I think train tickets
from Fengtai to Wuqing

1406
00:49:29,960 --> 00:49:32,320
will pile up in the corner of my desk.

1407
00:49:36,800 --> 00:49:39,040
Every single one will be a promise kept

1408
00:49:39,040 --> 00:49:41,360
to see each other at least three times

1409
00:49:41,360 --> 00:49:42,560
a week.

1410
00:50:05,440 --> 00:50:08,240
Don't smudge my makeup.

1411
00:50:08,240 --> 00:50:09,560
I'll just dab it gently.

1412
00:50:09,560 --> 00:50:10,600
Okay.

1413
00:50:10,600 --> 00:50:13,040
You once told me
to leave a spot at my desk

1414
00:50:13,040 --> 00:50:15,880
for our video calls.

1415
00:50:15,880 --> 00:50:17,160
Even though I just

1416
00:50:17,800 --> 00:50:19,360
finished my senior year

1417
00:50:19,360 --> 00:50:22,040
and don't even have a new desk yet,

1418
00:50:24,200 --> 00:50:24,960
in my heart,

1419
00:50:24,960 --> 00:50:25,720
that spot has already

1420
00:50:25,720 --> 00:50:27,480
been reserved for you.

1421
00:50:27,660 --> 00:50:33,140
(I've already reserved that spot
for you)

1422
00:50:43,240 --> 00:50:44,440
You once asked me

1423
00:50:44,440 --> 00:50:47,160
what would happen if I was really busy.

1424
00:50:47,160 --> 00:50:48,880
I said, "As long as you need me,"

1425
00:50:48,880 --> 00:50:50,280
"I'm not busy."

1426
00:50:54,600 --> 00:50:56,520
That was

1427
00:50:56,520 --> 00:50:57,880
a little idealistic,

1428
00:50:57,880 --> 00:50:59,920
but I'll do everything I can

1429
00:50:59,920 --> 00:51:00,840
to deal with it

1430
00:51:00,840 --> 00:51:02,760
whenever this situation

1431
00:51:02,760 --> 00:51:03,880
arises.

1432
00:51:03,880 --> 00:51:05,080
I'll be there for you

1433
00:51:05,080 --> 00:51:06,600
whenever you need me

1434
00:51:06,600 --> 00:51:08,680
and give you so many hugs.

1435
00:51:10,280 --> 00:51:11,560
This is so sweet.

1436
00:51:14,640 --> 00:51:18,160
Before I entered the house
and met everyone,

1437
00:51:18,160 --> 00:51:20,600
I was asked a question.

1438
00:51:20,920 --> 00:51:21,920
They asked me

1439
00:51:21,920 --> 00:51:24,520
what I'd say to my future boyfriend.

1440
00:51:28,400 --> 00:51:29,800
I said

