1492
00:53:26,280 --> 00:53:27,520
Cao Yiheng?

1493
00:53:27,880 --> 00:53:30,000
Will you keep walking this road with me,

1494
00:53:30,000 --> 00:53:31,440
Cao Yiheng?

1495
00:53:31,440 --> 00:53:32,960
(Will you keep walking this road
with me, Cao Yiheng?)

1496
00:53:32,960 --> 00:53:34,560
Of course I do.

1497
00:53:34,560 --> 00:53:36,480
