1498
00:53:36,480 --> 00:53:38,300
(Of course I do)

1499
00:53:42,600 --> 00:53:43,360
Come here.

1500
00:53:43,360 --> 00:53:44,560
I love that.

1501
00:53:46,160 --> 00:53:47,080
I love that.

1502
00:53:53,560 --> 00:53:54,760
This is perfect.

1503
00:53:54,760 --> 00:53:56,400
So perfect.

1504
00:54:00,800 --> 00:54:02,040
