1552
00:57:00,200 --> 00:57:02,600
Cui Kaiyi, I like you.

1553
00:57:02,600 --> 00:57:05,300
(Cui Kaiyi, I like you)

1554
00:57:10,240 --> 00:57:10,720
Oh my God!

1555
