1615
01:00:43,880 --> 01:00:46,700
Just like you.

1616
01:00:46,720 --> 01:00:47,400
Of course.

1617
01:00:47,400 --> 01:00:49,400
Anytime, anywhere.

1618
01:00:50,240 --> 01:00:51,400
Don't cry.

1619
01:00:54,880 --> 01:00:56,160
