1691
01:04:23,720 --> 01:04:24,560
So happy for them!

1692
01:04:24,560 --> 01:04:27,800
I'm so happy!

1693
01:04:30,640 --> 01:04:32,400
So romantic.

1694
01:04:33,040 --> 01:04:34,920
So beautiful.

1695
01:04:35,400 --> 01:04:36,040
I can only handle

1696
